<h1>Decision log</h1>
<p>Choices made and why, newest first. A decision recorded with its reasoning is
what lets somebody six months from now disagree with it on the merits instead of
re-deriving it.</p>
{% set items = manifest.docs | of_type("decision") %}
{% for p in items %}
<article class="card" style="margin-top:1.4rem">
  <p class="counts">{{ p.date }} · <a href="/{{ p.slug }}/">permalink</a></p>
  {{ p.slug | fragment | safe }}
</article>
{% endfor %}
